Global PCALLS
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Palette 0,$FFF,$F00,$0F0,$00F,$FF0,$0FF,$F0F
Menu$(1)=" File ","(IN 2,4) File "
Menu$(1,1)="(LO 2,1)(IN 2,6)Load","(IN 2,1)(IN 1,7)Load","(IN 2,2)Off","(IN 2,3)(BA 60,12)"
Menu$(1,2)="(EL 10,5)(LI 30,10)Shape"
Menu$(1,3)="(PA 3)(BA 40,8)(OU 1)(SL 3855)(BA 50,9)Pat"
Menu$(1,4)="(SS 1)Bold(SS 0)Plain"
Menu$(2)=" Opts "
Menu$(2,1)=" A " : Menu$(2,2)=" B " : Menu$(2,3)=" C "
Menu$(2,2,1)=" Sub1 " : Menu$(2,2,2)=" Sub2 "
Menu$(3)=" Bar "
Menu$(3,1)=" H1 " : Menu$(3,2)=" H2 "
Menu Line (3,1)
Menu Separate (2,2)
Menu Called (1,4)
Menu Inactive (1,1)
Menu Key (1,2) To "s"
Menu Key (2,3) To 80,0
Menu Calc
Print #1,X Menu(1);Y Menu(1);X Menu(2);Y Menu(2);X Menu(3);Y Menu(3)
For I=1 To 4 : Print #1,X Menu(1,I);Y Menu(1,I);" "; : Next I : Print #1,""
For I=1 To 3 : Print #1,X Menu(2,I);Y Menu(2,I);" "; : Next I : Print #1,""
Print #1,X Menu(2,2,1);Y Menu(2,2,1);X Menu(2,2,2);Y Menu(2,2,2);X Menu(3,2);Y Menu(3,2)
Menu Base 4,30 : Menu Calc : Print #1,X Menu(1);Y Menu(1);X Menu(2);Y Menu(2)
Menu Base 0,0 : Menu Line (1) : Menu Calc : Print #1,X Menu(2);Y Menu(2)
Menu Tline (1) : Menu Calc
Menu To Bank 15 : Print #1,Length(15)
Menu Del : Bank To Menu 15 : Erase 15
Menu Calc : Print #1,X Menu(2,2,1);Y Menu(2,2,1);X Menu(1,4);Y Menu(1,4)
Rem Menu Calc would call the procedure without the registers MnGere saves
Menu$(1,5)="(RE 16)(PR MPROC)Proc"
Menu On
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/keys" : Close 9
T=Timer : While Choice=0 and Timer-T<500 : Multi Wait : Wend
Print #1,Choice(1);Choice(2);Choice(3)
T=Timer : While Choice=0 and Timer-T<500 : Multi Wait : Wend
Print #1,Choice(1);Choice(2);Choice(3)
X Mouse=138 : Y Mouse=54
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/open" : Close 9
T=Timer : While Choice=0 and Timer-T<500 : Multi Wait : Wend
Print #1,Choice(1);Choice(2);Choice(3);PCALLS>0
X Mouse=138 : Y Mouse=54
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/drag" : Close 9
T=Timer : While Choice=0 and Timer-T<500 : Multi Wait : Wend
Print #1,X Menu(1);Y Menu(1);X Menu(2);Y Menu(2)
Cls 0 : Menu Mouse On
X Mouse=250 : Y Mouse=150
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/mouse" : Close 9
T=Timer : While Choice=0 and Timer-T<500 : Multi Wait : Wend
Menu Mouse Off : Menu Off
Print #1,Choice(1);Choice(2);Choice(3)
Menu Del : Menu Calc
Print #1,Choice(0)
Print #1,Choice(9)
Menu To Bank 16
Reserve As Work 16,100 : Bank To Menu 16
Bank To Menu 17
Print #1,"end"
Procedure MPROC
   Inc PCALLS
   If Dreg(2)
      Ink 3 : Bar Dreg(0),Dreg(1) To Dreg(0)+10,Dreg(1)+6
   End If
   Dreg(0)=Dreg(0)+12 : Dreg(1)=Dreg(1)+8
End Proc
